        "content": "<p>Hey y'all <span aria-label=\"man raising hand\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f64b-200d-2642\" role=\"img\" title=\"man raising hand\">:man_raising_hand:</span></p>\n<p>Here's a short video showing how I save a Lean game solution for later review and archiving:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/__SBraEkXOE\">https://youtu.be/__SBraEkXOE</a></p>\n<div class=\"youtube-video message_inline_image\"><a data-id=\"__SBraEkXOE\" href=\"https://youtu.be/__SBraEkXOE\"><img src=\"https://uploads.zulipusercontent.net/1a91caf0a87c00fdaf2918be2fe55c5a6b46edd0/68747470733a2f2f692e7974696d672e636f6d2f76692f5f5f53427261456b584f452f6d7164656661756c742e6a7067\"></a></div><p>If y'all know of another or better way, suggestions welcome.</p>\n<p>I basically just copy and paste all the text in the main solution frame.<br>\nI end up with something that looks like this in a text file:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1638x1936\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/bKHK1klCipadfvwW4PJnYNiT/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/bKHK1klCipadfvwW4PJnYNiT/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>I can easily read the solutions later on other systems<ul>\n<li>(instead of saving and loading the saved game JSON into other browsers).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>This format is nice and compact.</li>\n<li>It's easy to edit and annotate.</li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 581875526,
        "sender_full_name": "Eduardo Cavazos",
        "timestamp": 1774525275
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"243015\">Eduardo Cavazos</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Saving.20a.20Lean.20game.20solution.20in.20plain.20text.20for.20later.20review/near/581875526\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If y'all know of another or better way, suggestions welcome.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Click the editor button on the top right, then copy all the code</p>",
        "id": 581885540,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1774527994
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"933054\">Snir Broshi</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Saving.20a.20Lean.20game.20solution.20in.20plain.20text.20for.20later.20review/near/581885540\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"243015\">Eduardo Cavazos</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Saving.20a.20Lean.20game.20solution.20in.20plain.20text.20for.20later.20review/near/581875526\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If y'all know of another or better way, suggestions welcome.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Click the editor button on the top right, then copy all the code</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Hey <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"933054\">@Snir Broshi</span> <span aria-label=\"man raising hand\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f64b-200d-2642\" role=\"img\" title=\"man raising hand\">:man_raising_hand:</span></p>\n<p><code>Editor mode</code> provides the code, but without the intermediate goal states. So it looks something like this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Iff</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3</span>\n<span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>With the approach I demonstrate in the video, I get the intermediate states:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Active</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Goal</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Objects</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span>\n<span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span>\n<span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">⋃₀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span>\n<span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Iff</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Active</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GoalGoal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Objects</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span>\n<span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span>\n<span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">⋃₀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Active</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GoalGoal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Objects</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span>\n<span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span>\n<span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Assumptions</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"n\">h1</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⋃₀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">...</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 581886606,
        "sender_full_name": "Eduardo Cavazos",
        "timestamp": 1774528266
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Another benefit of this format...</p>\n<p>It makes it straightforward to search previous solutions for a symbol to see how I handled it... Importantly, it lets me search both the goals and the code used to transform the goals.</p>\n<p>Without this, I had to manually look through solutions from previous levels to see how I handled a setup with a particular symbol.</p>",
        "id": 581899434,
        "sender_full_name": "Eduardo Cavazos",
        "timestamp": 1774531272
    }
]